{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pulls/7","id":4993203731,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVVTne88AAAABKZ4-Ew","html_url":"https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pull/7","diff_url":"https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pull/7.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pull/7.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/issues/7","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pulls/7/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pulls/7/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/issues/7/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/statuses/2f4cdea1bc3e6706f49e37116ede8b1881472f7f","number":7,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: reliable video inference scheduling and truthful metrics (PR-04)","user":{"login":"TakashiSasaki","id":556958,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Njk1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/556958?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki","html_url":"https://github.com/TakashiSasaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Video inference previously repeated unchanged frames, and drawing, notification or speech exceptions could prevent the next RAF reservation. This change separates video arrival, owned latest-only execution, overlay drawing and bounded measurements; errors either recover on new input or expose an explicit stopped/retry state.\n\n- Prefer paired rVFC cancellation; use decoded-frame progress/currentTime in the RAF fallback. Independently validate model, camera, scheduler and temporary-scene generations.\n- Measure successful inference FPS, successful overlay draw FPS and the complete detectVideoFrame duration. Age 5-second/300-sample windows from the current clock, publish every 250 ms, and show unavailable/stalled states honestly.\n- Keep current appearance/ripple/callbacks fresh, notify/TTS only for new inference results, and repair smoothing after SDK exceptions without recreating the model.\n\nFrozen branch: `fix/inference-scheduler-metrics`\nHEAD: `2f4cdea1bc3e6706f49e37116ede8b1881472f7f`\nTree: `aaf506b0b70499da4a9474fc39b062841ed06965`\nActual base: `main` at `f1a0d0bbe343b666c75eae053340ceefc6730d5d`\n\nLocal Linux / Node 24.19.0 / npm 11.9.0: locked npm ci, typecheck, lint, **86 unit/component tests**, production build, **4 Playwright tests**, **7 CSS/JavaScript fault controls**, working-tree and complete base-diff whitespace checks all pass. The original main's 61 tests pass; new regressions fail on baseline for duplicate inference, each of drawing/notification/TTS scheduler failure, stale click ripple and post-error smoothing resurrection.\n\nLocal browser is system Chromium 154.0.8037.57: matched Chromium v1248 download returned HTTP 403 (retained evidence). Hosted matched-browser CI for this exact HEAD is **completed/success**: [run 40071091971](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/actions/runs/40071091971), [verify job 120804489259](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/actions/runs/40071091971/job/120804489259), terminal update **2026-10-24 06:41:43 UTC**.\n\nThe run metadata, exact-commit check-run, every job step and downloaded actual job logs were read back. Logs confirm checkout of `2f4cdea1bc3e6706f49e37116ede8b1881472f7f`, Node **24.19.0** / npm **11.17.0**, **86 tests**, matched Chromium/headless shell **v1248 / Chrome 156.0.8078.4**, **4 browser passes** (including native rVFC and fallback positive inference), and all **7 controls**: two healthy passes plus five intended diagnostic-specific child exits 1. Hosted execution used no local system-browser override. Browser evidence artifact **12551382365**, `playwright-report`, was uploaded successfully (digest `sha256:65238ab72d44cd344a0f8e22e007b2cd6e9e8df1e6ffec116f0c6588735d0d74`).\n\nThe remote commit/tree and unchanged base were verified, the local committed product/test hashes match the full local validation, and the complete main-to-HEAD whitespace check passes. All seven pre-existing branch refs remain unchanged; the only additional ref is this PR branch. No publication blocker remains. **Ready for separate independent review; independent acceptance remains outstanding.**\n\nPositive browser tests use native MediaStream/video progression with a separate explicit test-only SDK build, exercising the actual production scheduler in both rVFC and fallback paths. Test code is absent from the normal production artifact. These are synthetic input/SDK measurements, not physical-camera, real-model or GPU certification.\n\n[Architecture, formulas, states, command receipts, reproduced failures and review checklist](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/blob/2f4cdea1bc3e6706f49e37116ede8b1881472f7f/docs/verification/pr04.md) · [Local receipts](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/vision-edge/tree/2f4cdea1bc3e6706f49e37116ede8b1881472f7f/docs/verification/pr04)\n\n**Independent review handoff:** the parent will arrange a genuinely separate non-Author reviewer of this frozen HEAD. Focus on frame identity/cancellation, generation and lock ownership, all fault/retry paths, smoothing repair, metric mathematics/aging/retention, browser positive coverage and test-only SDK isolation. Author checks are not independent acceptance. In-scope findings will receive new commits, regression tests, full validation and exact-new-HEAD CI before separate re-review.\n\nRemaining limits: synchronous main-thread inference, currentTime-only timestamp precision, actual camera/model/GPU/audio and device background behavior unverified. No PR-05+, merge, auto-merge, deployment, branch-protection change or unrelated branch update. Historical Draft PRs #2/#4 remain untouched.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-24T06:39:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:43:17Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"713ae1871433c79e1df909da2999953670c2dd08","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TakashiSasaki:fix/inference-scheduler-metrics","ref":"fix/inference-scheduler-metrics","repo":{"id":1431627643,"node_id":"R_kgDOVVTnew","name":"vision-edge","full_name":"TakashiSasaki/vision-edge","owner":{"login":"TakashiSasaki","id":556958,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Njk1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/556958?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki","html_url":"https://github.com/TakashiSasaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TakashiSasaki/ev